      <title>题解：P11725 修学旅行</title>
      <link href="/2026/11/11/%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9AP11725%20%5BJOIG%202025%5D%20%E4%BF%AE%E5%AD%A6%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C/"/>
      <url>/2026/11/11/%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9AP11725%20%5BJOIG%202025%5D%20%E4%BF%AE%E5%AD%A6%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="Part-0-前情提要"><a href="#Part-0-前情提要" class="headerlink" title="Part.0 前情提要"></a>Part.0 前情提要</h2><ul><li>这篇题解与本题的其他题解有许多不同，其他题解无一例外全部是三叉线段树，而这篇题解，是适合初学线段树的同学学习的，基础二叉线段树题解。</li><li>只需了解线段树这种数据结构，或者能独立用线段树写出单点修改，查询区间加就能完全看懂这篇文章。</li></ul><h2 id="Part-1-简要题意"><a href="#Part-1-简要题意" class="headerlink" title="Part.1 简要题意"></a>Part.1 简要题意</h2><p>给定一个长度为 $3^N$ 的只包含 A 和 B 的字符串。每次将相邻三个字符合并为一个字符，三个字符中出现次数较多的字符作为合并结果，重复 $N$ 次操作后得到只剩下一个字符。</p><p>接下来有 $Q$ 次操作，每次翻转指定位置的字符（A 变 B，B 变 A），要求输出每次操作后最终剩下的那个字符。</p><h2 id="Part-2-思路解析"><a href="#Part-2-思路解析" class="headerlink" title="Part.2 思路解析"></a>Part.2 思路解析</h2><h3 id="2-1-思路简述"><a href="#2-1-思路简述" class="headerlink" title="2.1 思路简述"></a>2.1 思路简述</h3><p>对于一个已经学习线段树很久的人来说，遇到此题，会直接写出三叉线段树来维护这个序列，这当然是代码长度与时间复杂度都最优的选择，但是本人比较菜，只会普通的二叉线段树，所以考虑用二叉线段树维护这个东西。</p><p>我们注意到每次操作初始长度为 $3^N$ 的字符串，只需要经过 $N$ 此次操作就可以得到最后剩余的字符串，所以考虑用 $N$ 棵线段树维护每次操作前的字符串，编号从 $1$ 到 $n$，第 $i$ 个字符串的大小为 $3^i$，每个线段树维护对应字符串的 A 的数量， 最后查询第一个字符串中的 A 字符数量是否大于 $2$，如果大于就是输出 A，否则输出 B。</p><p>我们根据思路开始实现代码。</p><h3 id="2-2-建树"><a href="#2-2-建树" class="headerlink" title="2.2 建树"></a>2.2 建树</h3><p>建树部分的难点，主要在于编号为 $i$ 的字符串，怎样从编号为 $i+1$ 的字符串转移而来，其实非常简单，对于编号为 $N$ 的字符串，直接统计就可，否则，对于第 $i$ 个字符串的第 $x$ 个节点，可以从第 $i+1$ 个字符串的第 $x\times 3-2$ 到第 $x\times 3$ 个节点的 A 的数量决定，只要在这个区间内，A 的数量大于等于 $2$，这个节点的状态就为 $1$，否则为 $2$，然后进行最基础的区间合并。</p><p>建树及区间合并的代码如下：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//u0 表示这个区间里 A 字符的数量。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//p 表示这个线段树所维护的字符串的编号。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//为了方便，我们将字符串的 A 字符处理成了 数字 0，将 B 字符处理成了 1。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">pushup</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    tree[p][x].u0=tree[p][<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x)].u0+tree[p][<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x)].u0;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//将这个区间的左儿子和右儿子的 A 字符的数量相加。</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">build</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x,<span class="type">int</span> l,<span class="type">int</span> r)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    tree[p][x].l=l;</span><br><span class="line">    tree[p][x].r=r;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(l==r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(p==n) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(a[l]==<span class="number">0</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">//query(p,x,l,r) 函数查询的是：编号为 p 的字符串中区间 [l,r] 中的 A 字符数量。</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">//后面会提到这个函数。</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="built_in">query</span>(p<span class="number">+1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,l*<span class="number">3</span><span class="number">-2</span>,l*<span class="number">3</span>)&gt;=<span class="number">2</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> mid=(l+r)&gt;&gt;<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">build</span>(p,<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x),l,mid);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">build</span>(p,<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x),mid<span class="number">+1</span>,r);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">pushup</span>(p,x);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-3-单点修改"><a href="#2-3-单点修改" class="headerlink" title="2.3 单点修改"></a>2.3 单点修改</h3><p>单点修改操作与建树相同，编号为 $N$ 的字符串直接修改，编号为 $i$ 的字符串的第 $x$ 个字符，也是第 $i+1$ 个字符串的第 $x\times 3-2$ 到第 $x\times 3$ 个节点的 A 的数量决定，由于与建树的过程基本一致，这里不再赘述。</p><p>单点修改的代码：<br><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">change</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x,<span class="type">int</span> id)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(tree[p][x].l==tree[p][x].r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(p==n) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            tree[p][x].u0^=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="built_in">query</span>(p<span class="number">+1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,tree[p][x].l*<span class="number">3</span><span class="number">-2</span>,tree[p][x].l*<span class="number">3</span>)&gt;=<span class="number">2</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> mid=(tree[p][x].l+tree[p][x].r)&gt;&gt;<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(id&lt;=mid) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">change</span>(p,<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x),id);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">change</span>(p,<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x),id);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">pushup</span>(p,x);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><h3 id="2-4-查询"><a href="#2-4-查询" class="headerlink" title="2.4 查询"></a>2.4 查询</h3><p>与普通的线段树查询一致，唯一的区别就是增加了编号，代码如下：<br><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">query</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x,<span class="type">int</span> l,<span class="type">int</span> r)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(l&lt;=tree[p][x].l&amp;&amp;tree[p][x].r&lt;=r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> tree[p][x].u0;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> mid=(tree[p][x].l+tree[p][x].r)&gt;&gt;<span class="number">1</span>,da=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(l&lt;=mid) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        da+=<span class="built_in">query</span>(p,<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x),l,r);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(mid&lt;r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        da+=<span class="built_in">query</span>(p,<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x),l,r);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> da;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><h3 id="2-5-主函数"><a href="#2-5-主函数" class="headerlink" title="2.5 主函数"></a>2.5 主函数</h3><p>由于我们的建树与单点修改中已经可以通过输入编号自动处理了，所以直接用 <code>for</code> 循环，从后往前处理每一个字符串即可。</p><p>主函数代码：<br><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//FOR(a,b,c) for(int a=(b),a##end=(c);a&lt;=a##end;a++)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//ROF(a,b,c) for(int a=(b),a##end=(c);a&gt;=a##end;a--)</span></span><br><span class="line">cin&gt;&gt;n&gt;&gt;q;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">FOR</span>(i,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="built_in">qpow</span>(<span class="number">3</span>,n)) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">char</span> c;</span><br><span class="line">    cin&gt;&gt;c;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(c==<span class="string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        a[i]=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        a[i]=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">ROF</span>(i,n,<span class="number">1</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//从后往前处理每一个编号的字符串，编号每减 1，总长度就除以 3。</span></span><br><span class="line">    seg.<span class="built_in">build</span>(i,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="built_in">qpow</span>(<span class="number">3</span>,i));</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span>(q--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> id;</span><br><span class="line">    cin&gt;&gt;id;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">ROF</span>(i,n,<span class="number">1</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">//从后往前进行单点修改，注意每次修改的 id 都要进行变动，具体为 id=(id+2)/3。</span></span><br><span class="line">        seg.<span class="built_in">change</span>(i,<span class="number">1</span>,id);</span><br><span class="line">        id=(id<span class="number">+2</span>)/<span class="number">3</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(seg.<span class="built_in">query</span>(<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">3</span>)&gt;=<span class="number">2</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;A\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;B\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><h2 id="时间复杂度"><a href="#时间复杂度" class="headerlink" title="时间复杂度"></a>时间复杂度</h2><p>单次建树：$O(3^N)$。\<br>单词修改：$O(N)$。\<br>建树：$O(N3^N)$。\<br>查询：$O(QN^2)$。\<br>时间复杂度：$O(N3^N+QN^2)$。</p>]]></content>
      
      
